object: case_material | decision | Case material | outcome:enum[hard plastic and rubber,plastic,rubber,wood]
object: lcd | decision | LCD screen | outcome:enum[included,excluded]!reverse
object: navigation | decision | Navigation control | outcome:enum[push buttons,joystick]
object: colour | decision | Remote colour | outcome:enum[normal colour,special colour]

